# Project-specific
# Source data / lookup log workbook — supply your own, never commit.
# The workbook holds real applicant addresses in its LookupResults sheet, and
# v2 writes station coordinates back into it, so it is working data, not source.
data/*.xlsx
# Excel lock files, present while the workbook is open
~$*
